1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
⚡ YIELD-BOX · The Perpetual Agent Endowment Vault

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Every autonomous AI agent built today has an expiration date.

3
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:13,200
You fund its hot wallet with $200; it hits a recursive loop or queries expensive x402 APIs...

4
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:17,500
The balance drains to zero; the agent dies.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:23,610
Funding agents with consumable balances is broken.

6
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:28,500
We built YieldBox—the first perpetual endowment vault for PayBox agents.

7
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:35,000
Instead of giving the agent your savings, your principal is locked in MoonX MPC behind a passkey.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:41,500
The vault generates a 5.10% APY work allowance anchored to Short-Term US Treasuries...

9
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:47,510
...spending only what it earns in native Base USDC.

10
00:00:47,510 --> 00:00:52,000
Watch what happens when the agent tries to overspend.

11
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:57,000
Here, the vault holds $5 in accrued yield. The agent requests a $10 x402 query.

12
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Instantly—in zero milliseconds—Gate 1 trips: REJECT_GATE_1: YIELD_BUDGET_EXCEEDED.

13
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:08,000
The principal is 100% untouched. No model hallucination can bypass this.

14
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:13,240
Execution halts before touching PayBox MPC keys.

15
00:01:13,240 --> 00:01:19,000
When the agent requests a valid $0.05 micro-service, all gates clear...

16
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:25,000
...and construct the canonical PayBox x402 transaction proposal on Base.

17
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:33,010
Notice Test 15: the test suite connects live to Base Mainnet, queries block height, and verifies Base USDC.

18
00:01:33,010 --> 00:01:37,500
Double-build byte determinism: passed.

19
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:42,000
Official PayBox MCP protocol conformance: passed.

20
00:01:42,000 --> 00:01:46,500
15 adversarial assertions: clean.

21
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:53,930
YieldBox turns any PayBox agent into a self-funding worker that can never drain your savings.